<title>USA: Sears completes Orchard Supply tender offer.</title>
<headline>Sears completes Orchard Supply tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co said Thursday it completed a $35 a share tender offer for the outstanding common shares of Orchard Supply Hardware Stores Corp.</p>
<p>About 8,705,203 shares or about 98.67 percent of the outstanding shares were tendered under the offer, Sears said in a statement.</p>
<p>The offer expired September 18.  </p>
<p>In August, Sears agreed to acquire Orchard Supply Hardware in a transaction valued at $415 million.  Orchard Supply Hardware operates 61 hardware stores throughout California.</p>
<p>The acquisition was cleared under the Hart-Scott-Rodino antitrust act earlier this month.</p>
